⨯ union-key: union discriminator for 'Inner' cannot be @optional
  @ test.idl:2:21

 2 │ union Inner switch(@optional boolean) {
   │                     ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ @optional not allowed on discriminator
 3 │ case TRUE:
 4 │     string value;

  ? remove @optional from the discriminator
  * union discriminators must always be present

⨯ union-key: union variant 'inner' cannot use @key
  @ test.idl:11:6

  9 │ union Outer switch(long) {
 10 │ case 1:
 11 │     @key Inner inner;
    │      ˆˆˆ @key not allowed on union variant
 12 │ };

  ? remove @key from the variant or move it to the discriminator
  * only the union discriminator can be marked as @key
